{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/1700829dc0978b79c4af23b484778d03.avif?t=1757541178\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You\u2019ve reached a forgotten tower full of dangers, and there\u2019s no way to escape. Your only chance is to climb to the top of the tower and break the curse using the power of the runic artifacts. Help Maia and other explorers uncover the secrets of the cursed tower!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/c5d774b185b7f76255c5841aff2e15af.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/c5d774b185b7f76255c5841aff2e15af.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Shadowed Rune</strong> is a challenging action roguelike that you can play solo or in two-player co-op*. Combine the power of runes to discover new spells and climb the tower to break the curse. You\u2019ll face enemies that aren\u2019t as friendly as they seem, and puzzles where you\u2019ll need to wisely harness the power of the elements. Did I mention the bosses guarding each floor? They\u2019re only the beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Local co-op multiplayer requires at least one connected controller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/79821e0110cb6d1ac7dd9f1a4465e23a.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=127 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">An <strong>action roguelike adventure with bullet hell / bullet heaven-style combat</strong>, puzzles, hundreds of enemies, and powerful bosses that will push you to the limit.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d58726140a29637bfd63d3a830f49803.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d58726140a29637bfd63d3a830f49803.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op mode.</strong> Each new adventure can be played in two-player co-op, even online (via Steam Remote Play Together).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/ce2111bc36ffe8bd3b80e803b0b2719d.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/ce2111bc36ffe8bd3b80e803b0b2719d.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic system based on seven elements</strong> (water, fire, wind, earth, lightning, light, and darkness) allowing you to create 134,217,728 possible spell combinations, discover more than 30 different elements, and unlock hundreds of handcrafted spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/58d100029f126f8f52e797d1d7b0ccfe.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/58d100029f126f8f52e797d1d7b0ccfe.webp?t=1757541178\" class=\"bb_img\" width=549 height=229 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also find a complete <strong>Magic Compendium</strong> that lets you uncover powerful spells right in the middle of battle. Switch between runes and modify your attacks in real time to adapt your strategy without stopping the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower divided into seven floors with dozens of levels to explore awaits you, <strong>accompanied by your feline companion</strong>. And every adventure is different: levels change after each defeat. Are you ready to break the curse? Let\u2019s go on an adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/e1d12dc601b8d65e7485879c0171a8fc.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/e1d12dc601b8d65e7485879c0171a8fc.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, solve puzzles, face waves of enemies, and <strong>discover unique artifacts and powerful spells that will change the way you play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also be able to manage and upgrade <strong>your survivor camp</strong>, unlocking new challenges, cosmetic items, and learning more about the backstory of other characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/9d5818a7baff0266a4857416114c79b0.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/9d5818a7baff0266a4857416114c79b0.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor</strong> so you can create your own challenges and share them with friends, and play them solo or in co-op. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/93f831933de9a9be07f6cf15e2799e9f.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/93f831933de9a9be07f6cf15e2799e9f.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New demo available\u2026 NOW!</strong><br><strong>Early Access launch planned for Q4 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d82737a3ec1adf72ba0d14f8a7cb6657.avif?t=1757541178\" width=386 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two starting characters and one secret character to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three full floors of the tower with hundreds of levels to explore and powerful bosses to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, the game will be updated regularly based on community feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, 'The Shadowed Rune' will be available in English and Spanish, with more languages to be added as development progresses. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/81e5f3edf47b2164d17de5987b2ae3be.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/81e5f3edf47b2164d17de5987b2ae3be.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLANNED CONTENT DURING EARLY ACCESS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story expansion with new chapters and more endgame content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, artifacts, and characters to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics to be announced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation into more languages.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What happens once the game leaves Early Access and is officially released?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This project is very special, and our intention is to continue supporting it after release with free periodic content expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Don\u2019t forget to follow and add 'The Shadowed Rune' to your wishlist to stay up to date with all the news.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> An exciting journey awaits us!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/2bfdc297e5acd26dd50f6fa923b45b87.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/2bfdc297e5acd26dd50f6fa923b45b87.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2892040?t=1757541178","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/61363b53a6ce983fc5f6f163068d924d02892d13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757541178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/5334a00ecc0ca208942157e66607ef55c621d8ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757541178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/5334a00ecc0ca208942157e66607ef55c621d8ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757541178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3169740,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/1700829dc0978b79c4af23b484778d03.avif?t=1757541178\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You\u2019ve reached a forgotten tower full of dangers, and there\u2019s no way to escape. Your only chance is to climb to the top of the tower and break the curse using the power of the runic artifacts. Help Maia and other explorers uncover the secrets of the cursed tower!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/c5d774b185b7f76255c5841aff2e15af.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 he