"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/ce2111bc36ffe8bd3b80e803b0b2719d.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/ce2111bc36ffe8bd3b80e803b0b2719d.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic system based on seven elements</strong> (water, fire, wind, earth, lightning, light, and darkness) allowing you to create 134,217,728 possible spell combinations, discover more than 30 different elements, and unlock hundreds of handcrafted spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/58d100029f126f8f52e797d1d7b0ccfe.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/58d100029f126f8f52e797d1d7b0ccfe.webp?t=1757541178\" class=\"bb_img\" width=549 height=229 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also find a complete <strong>Magic Compendium</strong> that lets you uncover powerful spells right in the middle of battle. Switch between runes and modify your attacks in real time to adapt your strategy without stopping the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tower divided into seven floors with dozens of levels to explore awaits you, <strong>accompanied by your feline companion</strong>. And every adventure is different: levels change after each defeat. Are you ready to break the curse? Let\u2019s go on an adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/e1d12dc601b8d65e7485879c0171a8fc.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/e1d12dc601b8d65e7485879c0171a8fc.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment, solve puzzles, face waves of enemies, and <strong>discover unique artifacts and powerful spells that will change the way you play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/f78a6e93f948d31ffecfb2d57891d016.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also be able to manage and upgrade <strong>your survivor camp</strong>, unlocking new challenges, cosmetic items, and learning more about the backstory of other characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/9d5818a7baff0266a4857416114c79b0.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/9d5818a7baff0266a4857416114c79b0.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level editor</strong> so you can create your own challenges and share them with friends, and play them solo or in co-op. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/93f831933de9a9be07f6cf15e2799e9f.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/93f831933de9a9be07f6cf15e2799e9f.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROADMAP:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New demo available\u2026 NOW!</strong><br><strong>Early Access launch planned for Q4 2025.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/d82737a3ec1adf72ba0d14f8a7cb6657.avif?t=1757541178\" width=386 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two starting characters and one secret character to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three full floors of the tower with hundreds of levels to explore and powerful bosses to defeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, the game will be updated regularly based on community feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access, 'The Shadowed Rune' will be available in English and Spanish, with more languages to be added as development progresses. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/81e5f3edf47b2164d17de5987b2ae3be.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/81e5f3edf47b2164d17de5987b2ae3be.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLANNED CONTENT DURING EARLY ACCESS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story expansion with new chapters and more endgame content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies and final bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New spells to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More items, artifacts, and characters to interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics to be announced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translation into more languages.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What happens once the game leaves Early Access and is officially released?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This project is very special, and our intention is to continue supporting it after release with free periodic content expansions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Don\u2019t forget to follow and add 'The Shadowed Rune' to your wishlist to stay up to date with all the news.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> An exciting journey awaits us!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/2bfdc297e5acd26dd50f6fa923b45b87.poster.avif?t=1757541178\" width=549 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/extras/2bfdc297e5acd26dd50f6fa923b45b87.webm?t=1757541178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Javifugitivo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2892040/28193ca28a0bd3ebaa6b41d58dac9074e81af06b/header.jpg?t=1757541178","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257195862,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195862/movie480.mp4?t=1757541177","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195862/movie_max.mp4?t=1757541177"},"name":"The Shadowed Rune -  Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257195862/7414ff1731388409c64a04cb3e84e1ada13b4dfe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757541177","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257195862/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757541177","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.c